/span><span class="enc-snip">The Comanche, who call themselves Numunuu, are a Native American people who split from the Shoshone and moved onto the southern Plains in the early 18th century.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/comares-palace"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/comares-palace.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Comares Palace</span><span class="enc-type">Work / monument</span><span class="enc-snip">The Comares Palace is the official part of the Nasrid palaces of the Alhambra in Granada, built mainly under Yusuf I and Muhammad V in the fourteenth century.</span></a></li></ul>
